{"slug": "volume5-part1/275", "title": "26.", "volume": "volume5-part1", "sourceUrl": "https://budget.up.nic.in/Fin_H_Book/volume5/part1/275.html", "html": "<font color=\"#000080\" size=\"5\"><p align=\"CENTER\">FORM No. 26</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">[See Chapter XIII, paragraph 265]</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">Register of land</p></font>\n<table border=\"\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"4\" width=\"641\">\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"35%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Purpose for which required, and authority under which taken up</p></font></td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"65%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Detail of appropriation and compensation paid</p></font></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"25%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">(a) Number of sanctioned estimate ;</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">(b) Number and date of sanctioning authority (in red ink);</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">(c) Name of road or building or other work for which required (in black ink);</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">(d) Name of the pargana, mauza &amp; village in which the land is situated</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"10%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Date of Gazette and number of notification</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Area in Hectares</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Amount of cash compensation actually paid</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"13%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">(a) Month in which adjusted:</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">(b) Number and date of Collector’s letter giving possession of land</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">(c) Date of possession</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Number and date of award statement</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"12%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Number of plan showing the boundaries of the land in_____register of Plans</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"13%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Date of entry and initials of with certificate \"Copy of-plan no._____submitted to the_____with this office no._____dated_____.\"</p></font></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"25%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">1</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"10%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">2</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">3</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">4</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"13%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">5</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">6</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"12%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">7</p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"13%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">8</p></font></td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td height=\"402\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"25%\"><p></p></td>\n<td height=\"402\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"10%\"><p></p></td>\n<td height=\"402\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\"><p></p></td>\n<td height=\"402\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\"><p></p></td>\n<td height=\"402\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"13%\"><p></p></td>\n<td height=\"402\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\"><p></p></td>\n<td height=\"402\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"12%\"><p></p></td>\n<td height=\"402\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"13%\"><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<font size=\"2\"><p> </p></font>"}